    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41338" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιτήδ-ευμα</span></b> , Cret. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιτάδουμα</span></b>  (<i><span class="en">
			<u>SIG</u>
			721.12
		</span></i> (Delos (decree of Cnossus), <span class="entity">ii B.C.</span>)), <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>, τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>pursuit, business, custom,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ἐ. τῆς χώρας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					1.138
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				6.15
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μάθημα ἢ ἐ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>La.</u>
					180a
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς τίνα τέχνην ἢ τί
			ἐ.</span> ; <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>R.</u>
				455a
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Euthd.</u>
				275b
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρετὴ κάλλιστον τῶν ἐ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Isoc.
					10.54
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ καθ᾽ ἡμέραν ἐ.</span>
			everyday <i>habits,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Th.
				2.37
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Antipho
				3.2.10
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. πρὸς ὑμᾶς ἄλογον καὶ ἐς τὰ
					ἡμέτερα ἀξύμφορον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					1.32
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιτηδεύματα ἀρετῆς, καπηλείας,</span>
			<i>practice</i> of.., <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				711b
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				918a
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
