				Hp.
				<u>Epid.</u>
				1.23
			</span></i> : pl., <i>ways of living,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phdr.</u>
				233d
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Lg.</u>
				793d
			</span></i>.</div>
